   "description": "The creek Ložnica is a tributary of the Savinja and is managed by the RD Šempeter-from the outflow of the Hotinjščica to the bridge in Arja vas-11km long district with 4,4ha of water surface. You can fly fish or float fish on this part of the river. You can fly fish for salmonids: brown trouts, rainbow trouts and graylings or cyprinids: barbels, common nases, chubs and Danube roaches."
